  "prefLabel": "Tax 212.05 Burden of Proof",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Tax 212.05 Burden of Proof. The taxpayer shall have the burden of proving the assessment was disproportionate or illegal, resulting in the taxpayer paying a disproportionate share of taxes in accordance with Appeal of Town of Sunapee, 126 N.H. 214, 217 (1985).\n\nSource. #7874-B, eff 4-18-03; ss by #8987-A, eff 9-24-07 (from Tax 216.05); ss by #9538, eff 9-8-09); ss by #10625-B, eff 6-26-14 (from Tax 216.05); ss by #13711-B, eff 8-2-23",
